{
  "id": "u07-l05",
  "unit": "u07-directions",
  "title": "Rickshaw & CNG",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "To hail a rickshaw, call **এই রিকশা!** ('Hey, rickshaw!'), name the place and ask **যাবেন?** 'Will you go?' — **ধানমন্ডি যাবেন?** The destination often needs no ending, though **স্টেশনে যাব** ('I'll go to the station') works too. If the driver says **না**, ask the next one.\n\nCall drivers **মামা** (lit. 'uncle') or **ভাই**, and use the polite **যাবেন** and **থামেন**.\n\nThe future of 'go': **যাব** = 'I / we will go', **যাবেন** = 'you (polite) will go'. 'By rickshaw' takes the locative: **রিকশায় যাব**.\n\n**Agree the fare before you get in:** **ভাড়া কত?** If it sounds high, say **ভাড়া একটু বেশি** and counter: **পঞ্চাশ টাকা রাখেন?** To get off: **মামা, এখানে থামেন** (**এখানে রাখেন** also works). **কতদূর?** = 'how far?'\n\nA **সিএনজি** is the green gas-powered auto-rickshaw, faster for longer trips. (Kolkata: **অটো**.)",
